---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Brand from "../components/Brand.astro";

const base = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/`;
---

<BaseLayout
  title="HIDROSAT Atlas Argentina — Observación hídrica pública"
  description="Atlas público en desarrollo para explorar ríos, cuerpos de agua, embalses y activos hídricos publicados de Argentina con trazabilidad y límites claros."
>
  <main id="main" class="atlas" data-atlas>
    <div class="atlas__map-wrap" aria-hidden="true">
      <div id="atlas-map" class="atlas__map"></div>
      <canvas id="atlas-field" class="atlas__field"></canvas>
      <div class="atlas__grain"></div>
      <div class="atlas__vignette"></div>
    </div>

    <header class="atlas__topbar">
      <Brand inverse href={base} label="Volver a la página principal de HIDROSAT" />
      <div class="atlas__identity" aria-label="Identidad del producto">
        <span>ATLAS ARGENTINA</span>
        <small>Centro de observación hídrica civil</small>
      </div>
      <div class="atlas__mode">
        <span class="atlas__mode-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>Contexto público</span>
      </div>
      <a class="atlas__return" href={base}>Volver al sitio <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </header>

    <section class="atlas__intro" aria-labelledby="atlas-title">
      <p class="atlas__eyebrow"><span></span> EXPERIMENTO DE PRODUCTO · V0.1</p>
      <h1 id="atlas-title">El pulso del <span class="atlas__mobile-break">agua</span><br /><em>en Argentina.</em></h1>
      <p>Una primera capa pública para explorar la geografía hídrica del país, entender de dónde viene cada dato y distinguir entre contexto abierto y operación sensible.</p>
      <button class="atlas__access" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="atlas-access-panel" data-access-toggle>
        Cómo se protege la información <span aria-hidden="true">+</span>
      </button>
      <div class="atlas__access-panel" id="atlas-access-panel" hidden data-access-panel>
        <p><strong>Abierto:</strong> geografía y activos ya publicados por sus fuentes.</p>
        <p><strong>Restringido:</strong> alertas, detalle operativo, historial de inspecciones y cualquier información que eleve riesgos sobre infraestructura.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="atlas__layers" aria-label="Capas públicas del Atlas">
      <div class="atlas__panel-title">
        <span>Capas abiertas</span>
        <small>Seleccionar para ver u ocultar</small>
      </div>
      <div class="atlas__layer-list" role="group" aria-label="Control de capas">
        <button class="atlas-layer is-active" type="button" aria-pressed="true" data-layer="rivers">
          <i class="atlas-layer__mark atlas-layer__mark--river" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <span><strong>Ríos y cursos</strong><small>Hidrografía publicada</small></span>
          <b aria-hidden="true">01</b>
        </button>
        <button class="atlas-layer is-active" type="button" aria-pressed="true" data-layer="water-bodies">
          <i class="atlas-layer__mark atlas-layer__mark--body" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <span><strong>Agua y embalses</strong><small>Espejos y reservorios</small></span>
          <b aria-hidden="true">02</b>
        </button>
        <button class="atlas-layer is-active" type="button" aria-pressed="true" data-layer="water-works">
          <i class="atlas-layer__mark atlas-layer__mark--works" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <span><strong>Plantas publicadas</strong><small>Registro base a verificar</small></span>
          <b aria-hidden="true">03</b>
        </button>
      </div>
      <p class="atlas__source-note"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span> Las capas se consultan desde servicios geográficos del IGN. La cobertura, fecha y exactitud dependen de cada fuente.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="atlas__missions" aria-label="Vistas del territorio">
      <p>Vistas de cuenca</p>
      <div role="group" aria-label="Enfocar región">
        <button type="button" data-focus="national" aria-pressed="true">Federal</button>
        <button type="button" data-focus="plata" aria-pressed="false">Del Plata</button>
        <button type="button" data-focus="cuyo" aria-pressed="false">Cuyo</button>
        <button type="button" data-focus="patagonia" aria-pressed="false">Patagonia</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <aside class="atlas__review" aria-labelledby="review-title">
      <div class="atlas__review-head">
        <div>
          <p>Estado de operación</p>
          <h2 id="review-title">Señales para revisar</h2>
        </div>
        <span class="atlas__restricted">Restringido</span>
      </div>
      <div class="atlas__locked-state">
        <div class="atlas__locked-icon" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
        <p><strong>La bandeja de casos no es pública.</strong> Las señales generadas por sensores o agentes deben mostrar evidencia, incertidumbre y revisión humana antes de cualquier decisión.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="atlas__review-rule">
        <span>Regla de producto</span>
        <p>Una señal no confirma una fuga, contaminación, peligro ni responsable.</p>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <section class="atlas__timeline" aria-labelledby="timeline-title">
      <div class="atlas__timeline-label">
        <p id="timeline-title">Tiempo de observación</p>
        <strong data-time-label>Línea base</strong>
      </div>
      <div class="atlas__timeline-control">
        <input id="atlas-time" type="range" min="0" max="3" step="1" value="0" aria-describedby="atlas-time-help" />
        <div class="atlas__ticks" aria-hidden="true"><span>01</span><span>02</span><span>03</span><span>04</span></div>
      </div>
      <p id="atlas-time-help" class="atlas__timeline-help">Secuencia conceptual de interfaz. No representa una alerta ni una adquisición satelital real.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="atlas__readout" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-atlas-readout>
      <span></span>
      <p>Preparando capas públicas…</p>
    </div>

    <div class="atlas__legend" aria-label="Leyenda de estados">
      <span><i class="atlas__legend-open"></i> Fuente publicada</span>
      <span><i class="atlas__legend-review"></i> Revisión humana</span>
      <span><i class="atlas__legend-restricted"></i> Acceso restringido</span>
    </div>
  </main>

  <script>
    import "maplibre-gl/dist/maplibre-gl.css";

    const atlas = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-atlas]");
    const mapTarget = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#atlas-map");
    const readout = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-atlas-readout] p");
    const reducedMotion = window.matchMedia("(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)");

    const updateReadout = (message: string) => {
      if (readout) readout.textContent = message;
    };

    let map: import("maplibre-gl").Map | undefined;
    const layerIds = {
      rivers: "atlas-rivers",
      "water-bodies": "atlas-water-bodies",
      "water-works": "atlas-water-works",
    } as const;

    const mountMap = (maplibregl: typeof import("maplibre-gl")) => {
      if (!atlas || !mapTarget) return;
      map = new maplibregl.Map({
        container: mapTarget,
        center: [-64.7, -38.5],
        zoom: 3.12,
        minZoom: 2.25,
        maxZoom: 9,
        maxBounds: [[-76.4, -57.8], [-50.4, -20.1]],
        pitch: 17,
        bearing: -4,
        dragRotate: false,
        touchPitch: false,
        attributionControl: false,
        style: {
          version: 8,
          sources: {
            "argenmap-dark": {
              type: "raster",
              tiles: ["https://wms.ign.gob.ar/geoserver/gwc/service/tms/1.0.0/argenmap_oscuro@EPSG%3A3857@png/{z}/{x}/{y}.png"],
              tileSize: 256,
              scheme: "tms",
              attribution: "© Instituto Geográfico Nacional",
            },
            "ign-rivers": {
              type: "raster",
              tiles: ["https://ide.ign.gob.ar/geoservicios/rest/services/ANIDA/Hidrografia/MapServer/export?bbox={bbox-epsg-3857}&bboxSR=3857&imageSR=3857&size=256%2C256&f=image&format=png32&transparent=true&layers=show%3A0%2C1"],
              tileSize: 256,
              attribution: "Hidrografía: IGN",
            },
            "ign-water-bodies": {
              type: "raster",
              tiles: ["https://ide.ign.gob.ar/geoservicios/rest/services/ANIDA/Hidrografia/MapServer/export?bbox={bbox-epsg-3857}&bboxSR=3857&imageSR=3857&size=256%2C256&f=image&format=png32&transparent=true&layers=show%3A2%2C3"],
              tileSize: 256,
              attribution: "Hidrografía: IGN",
            },
            "ign-water-works": {
              type: "raster",
              tiles: ["https://wms.ign.gob.ar/geoserver/industria-servicios/wms?service=WMS&version=1.3.0&request=GetMap&layers=planta_potabilizadora_de_agua&styles=&format=image%2Fpng&transparent=true&width=256&height=256&crs=EPSG%3A3857&bbox={bbox-epsg-3857}"],
              tileSize: 256,
              attribution: "Plantas: fuente publicada por IGN",
            },
          },
          layers: [
            { id: "atlas-base", type: "raster", source: "argenmap-dark", paint: { "raster-saturation": -0.92, "raster-contrast": 0.45, "raster-brightness-max": 0.34 } },
            { id: layerIds.rivers, type: "raster", source: "ign-rivers", paint: { "raster-opacity": 0.76, "raster-saturation": 0.35 } },
            { id: layerIds["water-bodies"], type: "raster", source: "ign-water-bodies", paint: { "raster-opacity": 0.66, "raster-saturation": 0.25 } },
            { id: layerIds["water-works"], type: "raster", source: "ign-water-works", paint: { "raster-opacity": 0.9 } },
          ],
        },
      });

      map.addControl(new maplibregl.NavigationControl({ showCompass: false }), "bottom-right");
      map.on("load", () => {
        atlas.dataset.mapReady = "";
        updateReadout("Capas públicas consultadas desde IGN · el detalle operativo permanece restringido.");
      });
      map.on("error", () => {
        atlas.dataset.mapIssue = "";
        updateReadout("La vista base sigue disponible. Algunas capas externas pueden tardar en responder.");
      });
    };

    document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-layer]").forEach((button) => {
      button.addEventListener("click", () => {
        const key = button.dataset.layer as keyof typeof layerIds;
        if (!key || !map?.getLayer(layerIds[key])) return;
        const active = button.getAttribute("aria-pressed") === "true";
        map.setLayoutProperty(layerIds[key], "visibility", active ? "none" : "visible");
        button.setAttribute("aria-pressed", String(!active));
        button.classList.toggle("is-active", !active);
        updateReadout(`${button.querySelector("strong")?.textContent ?? "Capa"}: ${active ? "oculta" : "visible"}.`);
      });
    });

    const views = {
      national: { center: [-64.7, -38.5] as [number, number], zoom: 3.12, pitch: 17, bearing: -4 },
      plata: { center: [-58.6, -31.7] as [number, number], zoom: 4.6, pitch: 22, bearing: -9 },
      cuyo: { center: [-68.9, -33.2] as [number, number], zoom: 4.85, pitch: 21, bearing: 5 },
      patagonia: { center: [-69.2, -44.1] as [number, number], zoom: 4.12, pitch: 20, bearing: -8 },
    };

    document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-focus]").forEach((button) => {
      button.addEventListener("click", () => {
        const key = button.dataset.focus as keyof typeof views;
        if (!key || !map) return;
        map.flyTo({ ...views[key], duration: reducedMotion.matches ? 0 : 1050, essential: true });
        document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-focus]").forEach((item) => item.setAttribute("aria-pressed", String(item === button)));
        updateReadout(`Vista enfocada: ${button.textContent?.trim()}.`);
      });
    });

    const accessToggle = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-access-toggle]");
    const accessPanel = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-access-panel]");
    accessToggle?.addEventListener("click", () => {
      const expanded = accessToggle.getAttribute("aria-expanded") === "true";
      accessToggle.setAttribute("aria-expanded", String(!expanded));
      if (accessPanel) accessPanel.hidden = expanded;
    });

    const timeLabels = ["Línea base", "Nueva observación", "Comparación de cambio", "Caso para revisión"];
    const timeControl = document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>("#atlas-time");
    const timeLabel = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-time-label]");
    timeControl?.addEventListener("input", () => {
      const index = Number(timeControl.value);
      if (timeLabel) timeLabel.textContent = timeLabels[index] ?? timeLabels[0];
      atlas?.style.setProperty("--atlas-phase", String(index));
      updateReadout(`Secuencia conceptual: ${timeLabels[index] ?? timeLabels[0]}.`);
    });

    const mountField = (THREE: typeof import("three")) => {
      const field = document.querySelector<HTMLCanvasElement>("#atlas-field");
      if (!field) return;
      const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas: field, alpha: true, antialias: false, powerPreference: "low-power" });
      renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 1.5));
      renderer.setClearColor(0x000000, 0);
      const scene = new THREE.Scene();
      const camera = new THREE.OrthographicCamera(-1, 1, 1, -1, 0.1, 10);
      camera.position.z = 2;

      const fieldGroup = new THREE.Group();
      scene.add(fieldGroup);

      const sweepMaterial = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({ color: 0x00b9e8, transparent: true, opacity: 0.08, depthWrite: false, blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending });
      const sweep = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.PlaneGeometry(0.28, 2.8), sweepMaterial);
      sweep.rotation.z = -0.22;
      fieldGroup.add(sweep);

      const brightLine = new THREE.Line(
        new THREE.BufferGeometry().setFromPoints([new THREE.Vector3(0, -1.4, 0.1), new THREE.Vector3(0, 1.4, 0.1)]),
        new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({ color: 0xa9e1eb, transparent: true, opacity: 0.45 }),
      );
      brightLine.rotation.z = -0.22;
      fieldGroup.add(brightLine);

      const resizeField = () => {
        const rect = field.getBoundingClientRect();
        renderer.setSize(rect.width, rect.height, false);
        const aspect = Math.max(rect.width / Math.max(rect.height, 1), 0.25);
        camera.left = -aspect;
        camera.right = aspect;
        camera.top = 1;
        camera.bottom = -1;
        camera.updateProjectionMatrix();
      };
      resizeField();
      window.addEventListener("resize", resizeField, { passive: true });

      let pointerX = 0;
      let pointerY = 0;
      const finePointer = window.matchMedia("(hover: hover) and (pointer: fine)");
      const onPointerMove = (event: PointerEvent) => {
        if (!finePointer.matches || reducedMotion.matches) return;
        pointerX = (event.clientX / window.innerWidth - 0.5) * 2;
        pointerY = (event.clientY / window.innerHeight - 0.5) * 2;
      };
      window.addEventListener("pointermove", onPointerMove, { passive: true });

      let frame = 0;
      const renderField = (timestamp: number) => {
        const phase = Number(atlas?.style.getPropertyValue("--atlas-phase") || 0);
        if (!document.hidden && !reducedMotion.matches) {
          sweep.position.x = -1.75 + ((timestamp / 9000 + phase * 0.23) % 1) * 3.5;
          fieldGroup.rotation.z += (pointerX * 0.0022 - fieldGroup.rotation.z) * 0.025;
          fieldGroup.position.y += (pointerY * -0.006 - fieldGroup.position.y) * 0.025;
        } else {
          sweep.position.x = 0;
          fieldGroup.rotation.z = 0;
          fieldGroup.position.y = 0;
        }
        renderer.render(scene, camera);
        frame = window.requestAnimationFrame(renderField);
      };
      frame = window.requestAnimationFrame(renderField);

      window.addEventListener("pagehide", () => {
        window.cancelAnimationFrame(frame);
        window.removeEventListener("resize", resizeField);
        window.removeEventListener("pointermove", onPointerMove);
        renderer.dispose();
      }, { once: true });
    };

    const loadAtlas = async () => {
      try {
        const [maplibregl, THREE] = await Promise.all([import("maplibre-gl"), import("three")]);
        mountMap(maplibregl);
        mountField(THREE);
      } catch {
        updateReadout("No se pudo iniciar una capa visual. Volvé a intentar la vista del Atlas.");
      }
    };

    const scheduleAtlas = window.requestIdleCallback;
    if (typeof scheduleAtlas === "function") {
      scheduleAtlas(() => void loadAtlas(), { timeout: 320 });
    } else {
      setTimeout(() => void loadAtlas(), 0);
    }
  </script>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  :global(body) { background: #020812; overflow: hidden; }
  :global(.skip-link) { z-index: 100; }
  :global(.maplibregl-ctrl-bottom-right) { bottom: 11.5rem; right: 1.35rem; }
  :global(.maplibregl-ctrl-group) { background: rgb(3 17 31 / 0.86); border: 1px solid rgb(169 225 235 / 0.2); border-radius: 2px; box-shadow: none; }
  :global(.maplibregl-ctrl-group button) { height: 2.5rem; width: 2.5rem; }
  :global(.maplibregl-ctrl-group button + button) { border-color: rgb(169 225 235 / 0.15); }
  :global(.maplibregl-ctrl-icon) { filter: invert(88%) sepia(29%) saturate(347%) hue-rotate(142deg); }

  .atlas {
    --atlas-phase: 0;
    background: #020812;
    color: var(--hs-paper);
    height: 100svh;
    isolation: isolate;
    min-height: 39rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
  }
  .atlas::before { background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(0 185 232 / 0.12), transparent 21%, transparent 72%, rgb(0 185 232 / 0.06)); content: ""; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; position: absolute; z-index: 1; }
  .atlas__map-wrap, .atlas__map, .atlas__field, .atlas__grain, .atlas__vignette { inset: 0; position: absolute; }
  .atlas__map { background: radial-gradient(circle at 59% 42%, #0c2c3d, #041321 58%, #020812); }
  .atlas__field { height: 100%; pointer-events: none; width: 100%; z-index: 2; }
  .atlas__grain { background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 180 180' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='.9' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)' opacity='.42'/%3E%3C/svg%3E"); mix-blend-mode: soft-light; opacity: 0.13; pointer-events: none; z-index: 3; }
  .atlas__vignette { background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, transparent 34%, rgb(1 6 13 / 0.16) 67%, rgb(1 6 13 / 0.76) 100%); pointer-events: none; z-index: 4; }

  .atlas__topbar { align-items: center; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(169 225 235 / 0.15); display: grid; gap: 1.2rem; grid-template-columns: minmax(9rem, 1fr) auto 1fr auto; left: 0; min-height: 5.5rem; padding: 0 1.6rem; position: absolute; right: 0; top: 0; z-index: 10; }
  .atlas__topbar::after { background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgb(0 185 232 / 0.46), transparent); bottom: -1px; content: ""; height: 1px; left: 24%; opacity: 0.55; position: absolute; width: 19rem; }
  .atlas__brand { color: var(--hs-paper); display: inline-flex; width: max-content; }
  .atlas__brand :global(.brand) { font-size: 1.15rem; }
  .atlas__identity { border-left: 1px solid rgb(169 225 235 / 0.22); display: grid; gap: 0.12rem; padding-left: 1.15rem; }
  .atlas__identity span, .atlas__mode, .atlas__return, .atlas__eyebrow, .atlas__panel-title span, .atlas__missions > p, .atlas__review-head > div > p, .atlas__restricted, .atlas__review-rule span, .atlas__timeline-label p, .atlas__ticks, .atlas__timeline-help, .atlas__legend, .atlas__readout { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.58rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .atlas__identity span { color: var(--hs-glacier); }
  .atlas__identity small { color: rgb(220 233 232 / 0.56); font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 0.63rem; }
  .atlas__mode { align-items: center; color: var(--hs-glacier); display: flex; gap: 0.55rem; justify-self: end; }
  .atlas__mode-dot { background: var(--hs-signal); border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: 0 0 0 0.38rem rgb(0 185 232 / 0.08); height: 0.38rem; width: 0.38rem; }
  .atlas__return { color: var(--hs-paper); min-height: 2.75rem; padding-top: 1rem; text-decoration: none; }
  .atlas__return:hover { color: var(--hs-signal); }
  .atlas__return span { color: var(--hs-signal); font-size: 0.78rem; margin-left: 0.35rem; }

  .atlas__intro, .atlas__layers, .atlas__missions, .atlas__review, .atlas__timeline, .atlas__readout, .atlas__legend { position: absolute; z-index: 8; }
  .atlas__intro { left: clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 4.5rem); max-width: 30rem; top: clamp(7.5rem, 13vh, 9.5rem); }
  .atlas__eyebrow { align-items: center; color: var(--hs-signal); display: flex; gap: 0.7rem; margin: 0; }
  .atlas__eyebrow span { background: var(--hs-signal); height: 0.42rem; width: 0.42rem; }
  .atlas__intro h1 { font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 5.3vw, 5.9rem); letter-spacing: -0.07em; line-height: 0.88; margin: 1.3rem 0 1.25rem; max-width: 10ch; }
  .atlas__mobile-break { display: inline; }
  .atlas__intro h1 em { color: var(--hs-signal); font-style: normal; }
  .atlas__intro > p:not(.atlas__eyebrow) { color: var(--hs-mist); font-size: 0.93rem; line-height: 1.62; margin: 0; max-width: 28rem; }
  .atlas__access { align-items: center; background: transparent; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(169 225 235 / 0.38); color: var(--hs-paper); cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; font: 560 0.72rem/1.2 var(--font-body); gap: 1.1rem; margin-top: 1.4rem; min-height: 2.75rem; padding: 0; text-align: left; }
  .atlas__access span { color: var(--hs-signal); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 1rem; transition: transform 180ms ease; }
  .atlas__access[aria-expanded="true"] span { transform: rotate(45deg); }
  .atlas__access-panel { background: rgb(3 20 34 / 0.94); border-left: 2px solid var(--hs-signal); box-shadow: 0 1.2rem 2.5rem rgb(0 0 0 / 0.18); margin-top: 0.7rem; padding: 1rem 1.1rem; }
  .atlas__access-panel p { color: var(--hs-glacier); font-size: 0.72rem; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; }
  .atlas__access-panel p + p { border-top: 1px solid rgb(169 225 235 / 0.16); margin-top: 0.65rem; padding-top: 0.65rem; }
  .atlas__access-panel strong { color: var(--hs-paper); }

  .atlas__layers { background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgb(3 21 35 / 0.96), rgb(3 14 26 / 0.88)); border: 1px solid rgb(169 225 235 / 0.19); bottom: 1.45rem; left: clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 4.5rem); width: min(23rem, calc(100vw - 2.5rem)); }
  .atlas__panel-title { align-items: end; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(169 225 235 / 0.14); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 1rem 1.1rem 0.85rem; }
  .atlas__panel-title span { color: var(--hs-glacier); }
